# When another program deletes the inbox project while Quick Add is open, Enter adds nothing and the panel asks for a project.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
INBOX: @inbox
	- Rake leaves
END
keys q
type Mow
see Quick Add → INBOX
outside <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
hide Rake leaves
keys <Enter>
see Choose a project with Tab
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
